        "id": "E0",
        "kind": "feed",
        "text": "Across my conversations with leaders in government, critical infrastructure and regulated industries, one priority consistently rises to the top: putting technology to work on their most important systems while maintaining the control those systems require. This challenge is becoming more important ",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E1",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Advancing digital sovereignty with greater control and choice - The Official Microsoft Blog",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E2",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Digital sovereignty should give organizations greater control and security over the technology they depend on, while continuing to innovate.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E3",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Our approach to digital sovereignty starts with the workload.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E4",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Organizations can apply the level of control appropriate to each workload while maintaining a consistent approach to governance and operations across their digital estate.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E5",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Sovereign Public Cloud adds capabilities for workloads that require greater control and transparency while continuing to benefit from the scale and innovation of Azure.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E6",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Customers can combine public cloud, private cloud and partner capabilities across their digital estate, applying different levels of control to different workloads as their operating needs evolve.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E7",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Sovereign Control Panel , entering public preview at Microsoft Ignite, brings these signals together in a unified Azure portal experience.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E8",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Together, these capabilities provide additional technical and operational controls that can support a broader digital sovereignty strategy aligned to an organization’s legal, policy, security, resilience and business requirements.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E9",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "For some workloads, digital sovereignty also means maintaining critical operations as connectivity, geopolitical and operating conditions change.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E10",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "The ability to transition workloads from connected to disconnected operations is entering public preview, giving organizations greater flexibility to sustain critical services as connectivity and operating requirements change.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
        "checkedAt": "2026-10-26T16:47:33.844Z"
      },
      {
        "id": "E11",
        "kind": "body",
        "text": "Integration with Microsoft 365 Local , available in preview for approved customers, extends this functionality to locally operated Microsoft SharePoint and Exchange servers.",
        "sourceUrl": "https://blogs.microsoft.com/blog/2026/10/20/advancing-digital-sovereignty-with-greater-control-and-choice/",
        "source": "Microsoft (Official Blog)",
        "publishedAt": "2026-10-20T08:20:02.000Z",
